  "2026-07-31T10:15:11.751Z","harness:codex","Organization rationale 2026-07-31: moved from the portfolio root to pm-5oj5 because this is a bounded health evidence-projection defect, not a new roadmap program. Estimate 120m, medium risk, high confidence. pm-h90s is retained as provenance for the author-enforcement lineage; GH-831 remains the external source."
