  "2026-07-31T12:19:19.024Z","harness:codex","Acceptance evidence: complete actionable-event scan, samples_truncated, health verbose projection, explicit selector exclusivity, SDK client, CLI, MCP, and append-only bulk disposition all pass focused and full release coverage. Hosted-analysis gate is the only pre-push unavailable stage because it requires the exact pushed commit."
